WEBVTT

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.690
Light and Darkness.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.540
The final battle of the gods
climaxed in a clash between...

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:17.760
Marfa, Goddess of All Creation,
and Kardis, Goddess of Destruction.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.550
At the end of their fierce
battle, the stricken goddesses...

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:27.160
had split the continent,
forming a new land.

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:31.570
Since then, people have come
to call this new continent...

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:36.010
"Lodoss - The Accursed Island."

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:57.360
Let's get out of here!

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:00.490
Get the women and children
under cover! Move it!

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:13.480
Go now, Ashram.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:24.180
Smashing this place will
have to bring Fahn out to me.

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:37.150
Damn you, monsters!

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:49.110
Soon you will meet
your true enemy.

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:55.290
He comes.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:15.220
Having learned the intentions
of the witch, Karla...

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:19.970
Parn and his friends leave Wort's
castle and race back to Valis.

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:24.820
However, the advance of the
dark emperor, Beld...

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:30.790
is far faster than
Valis had anticipated.

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:34.480
Where the forces
of darkness pass...

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:39.010
they leave behind for the
survivors only scorched earth...

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:43.310
and despair that no
amount of prayer could heal.

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:09.150
Speak to me!
Are you all right?

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:10.030
Hang on!

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:20.090
How could
they do this?

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:23.170
This is what
happens in a war.

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:26.180
Valis would never
be this cruel!

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:28.680
Perhaps.

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:32.900
But war shows no prejudice
towards its victims.

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:36.350
Soldiers, villagers, women,
children, the old...

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:39.820
No one escapes
death in battle.

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:41.440
Parn!

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:45.640
Go back to King
Fahn ahead of us.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:49.950
Slayn...
You're staying here?

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.430
Just let us handle this.

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:55.200
King Fahn must be anxious
to hear what we've learned.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.380
But...

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:04.840
You're right.

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:08.200
We'd best be off then,
right Parn?

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:11.430
Man, oh man.

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:14.830
Etoh.

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:16.890
We'll do what we can.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:25.530
Hey, wait up!
I'm coming too!

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:11.910
Kashue's advance party will
be departing Valis tomorrow.

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:18.250
We'll probably meet
somewhere around there.

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:25.910
Ashram, join your forces with
the elves and set out ahead of us.

00:07:25.910 --> 00:07:28.010
A sneak attack,
my lord?

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:33.010
If we don't change tactics,
we'll meet our end in no time.

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:39.320
Don't think of our
losses as sacrifices.

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:40.890
They're a shield.

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:43.770
As you will be
if you meet your end.

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:47.270
As you may be
as well, my lord.

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.380
Bloody...!

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:04.360
Pirotess is one of the greatest
of the Dark Elf women.

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:07.920
She is not one to
dally with human men!

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:11.800
Oh no?! Are you saying
humans are lower than you?

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:14.800
You think yourself superior?

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:17.300
You...
You son of a...!

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:26.900
God damned...!

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:33.740
Now die!

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:39.790
Captain!

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:43.190
Make light of us,
will you?!

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:49.760
Know this! Men who
don't know their limits...

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:51.210
have no place in our forces!

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:54.220
Yeth...
Yeth, ther...

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:06.560
You've returned safely.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:07.450
Yes, majesty.

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:09.330
Then tell me what
you've learned.

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:15.060
Certainly. As we guessed, she is a survivor
of the Kingdom of Sorcery.

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:21.520
For these past 500 years,
in different forms and guises...

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:25.530
when the balance in Lodoss
is tipped, she appears.

00:09:25.530 --> 00:09:29.820
She uses her power to affect
the course of history.

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:35.650
Prince and peasant alike
are merely pawns to her.

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:38.040
Just as we suspected.

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:41.730
Pawns of history.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:45.640
Parn's returned?

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:47.940
King Kashue!

00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:53.920
Well? Sound of body?

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:56.630
Don't go and fade away
on me like some mirage!

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:01.450
Sire!

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:03.520
If you keep knocking
him around like that...

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:06.740
he'll BREAK before
he gets a chance to fade away!

00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:07.460
Deed...!

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:11.110
Forgive me.

00:10:13.820 --> 00:10:17.970
Parn, there's something
I wish to give you.

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:21.070
That's...

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:25.520
The armor of a Holy Knight.
My gift to you.

00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:29.980
Would you wear it
and fight at my side?

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:33.150
Parn?

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:38.490
Highness...
I've a favor to ask.

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:43.490
I appreciate your
gift with all my heart.

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:44.660
But...

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:49.120
the sword and armor left
to me by my father, Tessius...

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:52.500
are all that
I wish to carry.

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:55.500
I see.

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:58.310
Well then, why not
take the shield?

00:10:58.310 --> 00:11:00.010
You don't have
one of your own.

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:01.630
Yes, sir!

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:09.810
King Fahn, the Holy Knights have
gained a fine new member this day!

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:14.510
Do well, Parn.

00:11:14.510 --> 00:11:15.320
Sir!

00:11:15.590 --> 00:11:18.070
Oh, gimme a break!

00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:32.120
Parn...
I'll be waiting.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:33.180
Sire.

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:39.600
Who--?!

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:43.340
Wood?!

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:46.310
If that was a joke,
it was in very poor taste!

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:48.220
Calm down.

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:53.310
Just wanted to see what a kid
facing his first war is made of.

00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:57.570
Don't worry! I'll protect
King Fahn, no matter what!

00:11:57.810 --> 00:12:00.900
No matter how many men
you might have to kill?

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:03.820
Wood, you talk too much!

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:07.340
Hey, hey. Pretty ladies
shouldn't make scary faces.

00:12:07.340 --> 00:12:08.830
It isn't very pleasant.

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:11.300
Wood, just talk
straight for once.

00:12:11.720 --> 00:12:15.800
Well, now that you're a knight,
you're probably gonna end up...

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:18.030
forgetting about all
the pain we saw coming here.

00:12:18.030 --> 00:12:20.190
This has to be done!

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:23.850
If you can't forget it,
you're in trouble.

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:27.850
Because if you don't,
you won't be able to kill!

00:12:28.650 --> 00:12:30.270
Helluva choice, huh?

00:12:32.530 --> 00:12:33.590
Parn.

00:12:58.780 --> 00:12:59.670
Slayn.

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:06.180
Ghim!

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:12.460
You're going to Karla's alone
and expect to defeat her?

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:13.890
I don't expect to win.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:16.190
So you're throwing
your life away?

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:21.710
Will rushing into
this bring Leylia back?

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:25.540
I can't wait any longer!

00:13:27.350 --> 00:13:33.260
"Leylia?" Yes, I believe
that <i>was</i> this body's name.

00:13:33.260 --> 00:13:36.900
But all that
remains now is myself.

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:45.360
Once we've attended to these
people, I'll go with you.

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:46.180
So, for now...

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:48.940
Slayn...
What are you--?!

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:52.320
Slayn!

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:55.890
You enchanted him?

00:13:55.890 --> 00:14:00.620
The battle is still to come.
He needs his rest.

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:03.190
Though I doubt
he'd see it that way.

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:07.160
When will the battle come?

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:08.700
Soon now.

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:14.700
Ghim's... And Parn's...
Both have battles to fight.

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:21.240
Whatever.
No need to lose hope.

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:22.710
Best not to forget that.

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:34.720
You called for me, majesty?

00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:39.160
The main force
leaves tomorrow.

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:41.820
You'll let me come,
won't you?

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:46.040
I'm not sure if I'll be
returning from this battle.

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:48.240
Highness, you shouldn't
think things like that!

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:53.450
What I'm about to tell you would
have been revealed sooner or later.

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:54.830
Sire?

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:58.210
Would you listen to me?
To an old story?

00:14:58.210 --> 00:14:59.460
"Old story...?"

00:14:59.780 --> 00:15:05.920
Of when Valis wasn't nearly as
stable a nation as it is today.

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:09.250
I and the Holy Knights
were attempting...

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:11.590
to form a union of the
different areas of our land.

00:15:11.830 --> 00:15:14.710
To unite Lodoss?

00:15:16.420 --> 00:15:23.610
I didn't want to do it by force,
so I made many treaties.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:39.700
So, the king of Valis
would break our treaty?!

00:15:41.590 --> 00:15:45.590
At that time, one tribe was being
harassed by Shooting Star...

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:47.630
the demon dragon of
Fire Dragon Mountain.

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:09.610
Citing our defense treaty...

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:15.810
they demanded my newborn
daughter Fianna as a sacrifice.

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:18.810
But, I...!

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:31.450
Taking Fianna back would
have broken the treaty.

00:16:31.980 --> 00:16:32.590
You...?

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:35.440
I will retrieve the princess,
your majesty.

00:16:35.440 --> 00:16:36.300
But...!

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:39.730
No treaty is
worth a human life!

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:40.600
Tessius.

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:43.060
This is my plan alone.

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:47.320
You'll simply appear to have a
bad subordinate in your ranks.

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:48.610
Wouldn't that be acceptable?

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:57.620
Fianna was returned safely.

00:16:57.960 --> 00:17:01.170
When war broke
out with that tribe...

00:17:01.170 --> 00:17:05.550
Tessius silently
left for the front.

00:17:05.550 --> 00:17:09.630
I never saw him again.

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:16.640
I have never so despised
my position as king as that time.

00:17:28.090 --> 00:17:29.180
Father.

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:42.130
Found you!

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:12.570
Deed.

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:14.810
I want you to
stay behind tomorrow.

00:18:20.610 --> 00:18:21.660
Deed!

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:23.830
No.

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:27.330
We don't know if we'll
even be coming back!

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:30.210
Then why are you going?

00:18:31.440 --> 00:18:37.090
Because... all I can do now is
keep moving forward. That's why!

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:41.600
Then I'll be there
to guard your rear.

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:43.760
Deed...!

00:18:44.990 --> 00:18:48.110
The world's full of people who
will try and get you from behind.

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:51.520
Let me handle them, and keep
your eyes on what's ahead.

00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:53.050
Deed.

00:19:15.830 --> 00:19:16.760
By your leave...

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:32.150
Let's go!

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:40.360
Allow me to accompany you.
I shall serve you well.

00:20:03.030 --> 00:20:06.200
Tomorrow shall see a mountain
of corpses, a sea of blood!

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:10.910
Kardis, it shall be the greatest
of all sacrifices to you!

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:27.700
Narse...
What troubles you?

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:30.450
It is still too soon
for you to emerge.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:35.320
Your strength is not yet needed.
Wait until it is.

00:20:36.950 --> 00:20:39.580
Who?!
Who is calling to him?

00:20:41.030 --> 00:20:42.130
Can it be...?

00:20:57.370 --> 00:21:02.200
Strange... None of our
scouts have returned yet.

00:21:14.490 --> 00:21:17.290
M'lord! It's one
of the scouting party!

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:38.360
Trying to confuse us by using
our own men against us?!

00:21:48.380 --> 00:21:51.280
Stand firm!
They're no better than animals!

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:54.790
Scowl! Shout! Threaten!

00:22:02.930 --> 00:22:04.840
Damn you...!

00:22:12.510 --> 00:22:14.560
Thirty years
have come and gone.

00:22:15.610 --> 00:22:19.400
And two men once
worshipped as heroes...

00:22:19.400 --> 00:22:22.530
now cross swords
for control of Lodoss.

00:22:23.210 --> 00:22:28.360
Two friends who once fought side
by side now fight to the death...

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:30.660
as their echoes resound
throughout the land.

00:22:30.660 --> 00:22:36.660
Their battle shall become a legend
that will be told for generations.

00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:56.780
Once, they were friends.

00:22:58.230 --> 00:23:00.490
Once, they were allies.

00:23:02.320 --> 00:23:07.490
And after thirty years, is battle
the only thing left for them?

00:23:09.390 --> 00:23:11.990
Next time, on
Record of Lodoss War:

00:23:11.990 --> 00:23:14.990
Episode 7 - "The War of Heroes"

00:23:16.420 --> 00:23:19.270
I shall defend the peace
of Lodoss with my life!
